    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this exciting game, you control a cat wielding a powerful jetpack and embark on a thrilling journey through a dangerous cyberpunk world. Your main task is to collect food, which is necessary to survive in this futuristic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and dynamic game with platformer elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyberpunk style: bright neon lights, huge cities and futuristic technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny main character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the cat in his adventures through the megalopolis of the future and show who in this world is the real jetpack master!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this exciting game, you control a cat wielding a powerful jetpack and embark on a thrilling journey through a dangerous cyberpunk world. Your main task is to collect food, which is necessary to survive in this futuristic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and dynamic game with platformer elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyberpunk style: bright neon lights, huge cities and futuristic technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny main character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the cat in his adventures through the megalopolis of the future and show who in this world is the real jetpack master!</p>",
